TITLE:: ProbeScope
summary:: Modernized oscilloscope wrapping native ScopeView with theme styling
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/Stethoscope

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeScope wraps SuperCollider's native ScopeView (powered by ScopeOut2 and shared-memory QcScopeShm) in an elegant, theme-consistent window with an overlaid transparent grid, multi-channel wave colors, and keyboard shortcuts.

Audio thread safety is strictly preserved: rendering uses the native shared-memory buffer path, adding zero additional audio DSP overhead.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Opens and returns a new ProbeScope window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server (must be a local server for shared-memory scoping).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio or control bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels to scope.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::, code::\phosphor::, code::\ice::, etc.).

ARGUMENT:: rate
code::\audio:: or code::\control::.

ARGUMENT:: style
Display mode: code::\overlay:: (superimposed), code::\tracks:: (stacked channels), or code::\xy:: (Lissajous stereo).

ARGUMENT:: bufSize
Buffer size in frames (default: 4096).

METHOD:: view
Embed the oscilloscope into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Parent view or window.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Dimensions and position as link::Classes/Rect::.

ARGUMENT:: server
Target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio or control bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Visual theme.

ARGUMENT:: rate
code::\audio:: or code::\control::.

ARGUMENT:: style
Display style: code::\overlay::, code::\tracks::, or code::\xy::.

ARGUMENT:: bufSize
Scope buffer size in frames.

ARGUMENT:: showToolbar
Boolean indicating whether to show top toolbar controls.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: scopeView
Returns the underlying PB_ScopeView composite view.

METHOD:: theme
Changes theme palette dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: scopeStyle
Switches display mode: code::\overlay::, code::\tracks::, or code::\xy::.

ARGUMENT:: aStyle
Style mode symbol.

METHOD:: yZoom
Adjusts vertical amplitude zoom.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float zoom factor.

METHOD:: xZoom
Adjusts horizontal time zoom.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float zoom factor.

METHOD:: cycle
Sets window frame cycle length.

ARGUMENT:: frames
Integer cycle frame size.

METHOD:: triggerMode
Sets the oscilloscope triggering mode.

ARGUMENT:: mode
Trigger mode: code::\free::, code::\rising::, or code::\falling::.

METHOD:: triggerThreshold
Sets the waveform trigger threshold level.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float threshold amplitude.

METHOD:: resetZoom
Resets both X and Y zoom factors to 1.0.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of oscilloscope updates.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: close
Closes window and frees ScopeBuffer and analysis Synth.

SECTION:: Keyboard Shortcuts
list::
## strong::+ / =::: Zoom in vertically
## strong::- / _::: Zoom out vertically
## strong::s::: Cycle through display styles (Overlay -> Tracks -> X/Y)
## strong::Spacebar::: Freeze / Resume waveform drawing
::
